			<div class="content" id="post-content-796049">
									

<p>Overall, it seems decently enough written. A few words seem out of place, 'piecemeal' for example. Some of the test logs seem like they could use something…more, I suppose. Too much is left unexplained in them about what is being seen. While this can be good for some things, and it is good to not explain everything, it seems to leave out a bit too much here.<br />
The termination of D-Class seems a bit excessive for an SCP like this, as well. But, that might just be me.</p>

